OL,3,GNEWSACalls for change to school lunch
OL,4,Aas pupils go hungry
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum has said her son has repeatedly
OL,7,Fcome home from his new school hungry
OL,8,Fbecause the lunch break has been too
OL,9,Fshort and the queues too long for him
OL,10,Fto get food.
OL,12,FPupils at Holgate Academy, in Hucknall,
OL,13,FNottinghamshire, have 40 minutes for
OL,14,Flunch, and usually the whole school
OL,15,Fgoes at the same time.
OL,17,FHannah and several other parents told
OL,18,Fthe BBC this led to long queues and
OL,19,Ftheir children, including those on free
OL,20,Fschool meals, not being served.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
