OL,3,GNEWSACalls for change to school lunch
OL,4,Aas pupils go hungry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe school said it had made temporary
OL,7,Fchanges to help year 7 students "adjust
OL,8,Fto life in a large secondary school"
OL,9,Fand were confident the situation would
OL,10,F"settle into its normal rhythm".
